# Pocket Monsters Crystal (Japan): character table for encoding.type table8.
# The character code is the tile number of the game's own font; voiced kana are codes of
# their own. The <nameXX> entries are bytes the game draws as a name read from memory. The
# 17 bytes that draw a fixed string are not here: the profile lists where each string is in
# the ROM (encoding.rom_strings), and it is read from there.
